# ACT-POLYC-IR-BOUNDARY03-CORRECTION03: emitted-assembly witnesses are
# captured verbatim under evidence/ for AC-04. The blanket *.s rule
# above would otherwise silently drop them. List each file explicitly
# (git's negation rules are order-dependent; a directory-level
# negation after a *.s rule is not sufficient in this version).
!evidence/ir-boundary03-correction03/witness-02-emitted/witness-02-x86_64-apple-darwin.s
!evidence/ir-boundary03-correction03/witness-02-emitted/witness-02-aarch64-apple-darwin.s

# ACT-POLYC-LLVM-SPIKE01-RESUME01: host-specific shims pointing into
# /nix/store paths that are reproducible from `nix shell nixpkgs#cmake`
# and `nix shell nixpkgs#llvmPackages_22.llvm.dev`. Never commit
# absolute Nix store paths into the repository.
.llvm-shim

