# ACT-POLYC2-DAFNY-PROOF-MVP01: Dafny 4.11.0 distribution
# and bundled Z3 binary used by
# scripts/quality/formal-dafny.sh. The script does NOT
# download or provision these; it expects them to
# already exist at the paths below and exits 2 if they
# do not. Provisioning is documented in
# evidence/ACT-POLYC2-DAFNY-PROOF-MVP01/toolchain.txt
# (upstream URL, distribution archive digest,
# extracted executable digests).
#
# Excluded from git because the upstream artefact is
# reproducible from the recorded URL. SHA-256 of the
# upstream archive:
#   dafny-4.11.0-arm64-macos-13.zip  c90c75e7...d383a572f
tools/dafny/dafny-4.11.0-arm64-macos-13.zip
tools/dafny/dafny-4.11.0/
